# Unity 的場景 / Prefab 是文字檔，統一換行符號，避免 Windows / Mac 組員之間出現整份檔案都被改掉的假差異
*.cs        text eol=lf
*.unity     text eol=lf
*.prefab    text eol=lf
*.asset     text eol=lf
*.mat       text eol=lf
*.meta      text eol=lf
*.controller text eol=lf
*.anim      text eol=lf
*.inputactions text eol=lf

# 二進位檔
*.fbx  binary
*.blend binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.zip  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.tif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.hdr filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.exr filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
